<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch state cuts tap price of 2007 bond to 101.05.</title>
<headline>Dutch state cuts tap price of 2007 bond to 101.05.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry lowered the price for tap sales of the government's new 5.75 percent bond due February 2007 to 101.05 from 101.15 on the third day of sales.</p>
<p>Tap sales will continue daily from 0800 GMT until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
